# Physical mods - obsidian (actions/obsidian/obsidian_physical_mods.kbd)
**phys + lctl + b**         -- Page Up
**phys + lctl + f**         -- Page Down
**phys + lctl + t**         -- Tabs New
**phys + lctl + ,**         -- Setting
**phys + lctl + ;**         -- Vimola
**phys + lctl + [**         -- Omni [
**phys + lctl + ]**         -- Omni ]
**phys + lctl + lsft + t**  -- Tabs Undo Close
**phys + !lctl + a**        -- Select All Text
**phys + !lctl + b**        -- Bold Text
**phys + !lctl + e**        -- Toggle Edit Mode
**phys + !lctl + p**        -- Select Files
**phys + !lctl + r**        -- Toggle Source Mode
**phys + !lctl + ,**        -- Setting
**phys + !lctl + lsft + p** -- Mod; Mod;
